{
  "id": "g1_village",
  "campaign": "grace",
  "world": "nkwoAgu",
  "act": 1,
  "number": 1,
  "title": "Chapter 1 — The Market of Hunger",
  "description": "Nkwọ-Agụụ. Ike Money comes home with a Benz. Emeka needs ₦150,000 to follow him to Lagos, and every way to get it costs someone.",
  "startScene": "dawn",
  "scenes": {
    "dawn": {
      "beats": [
        {
          "type": "setFlag",
          "flags": [
            "ikeAround"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "cutscene",
          "cards": [
            {
              "title": "Grass to Grace",
              "text": "Nkwọ-Agụụ. The market of hunger. The name was a joke once. Nobody laughs at it any more."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "Dawn. The cock crows twice and gives up. Nne is already awake, counting palm-oil money that does not add up."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nneEmeka",
          "text": "{name}. Papa's creditors came again yesterday. I told them my son is a graduate. They laughed. Graduates don't pay debts, they said."
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "speaker": "nneEmeka",
          "text": "What will you do, my son?",
          "options": [
            {
              "text": "\"Lagos, Nne. That's where money lives.\"",
              "effects": {
                "remember": {
                  "emekaDream": "lagos"
                },
                "changeStat": {
                  "motherBond": -2
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "\"I'll find work here. Somehow.\"",
              "effects": {
                "remember": {
                  "emekaDream": "stay"
                },
                "changeStat": {
                  "motherBond": 3
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "\"Papa's debts are eating us. I will do something.\"",
              "effects": {
                "remember": {
                  "emekaDream": "debts"
                },
                "changeStat": {
                  "conscience": -2
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "Then: horns. Three cars, one of them a white Benz with tinted glass, crawl up the village road. Children run after them. Ike Money is home."
        },
        {
          "type": "freeRoam",
          "objective": "Ike Money is back from Lagos. Everybody is going to his villa. Go and see him.",
          "goal": {
            "talkTo": "ike"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "goto",
          "scene": "ikeVilla"
        }
      ],
      "location": "emekaHome",
      "time": "dawn"
    },
    "ikeVilla": {
      "beats": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "ike",
          "text": "Emeka! My guy! Look at you. Still in Nkwọ-Agụụ. Still wearing the shirt from our final-year dinner."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "ike",
          "text": "Me? Lagos. Business. Import, export, connection. Look at this watch. It tells time in three countries."
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "speaker": "ike",
          "text": "(He sprays naira notes on the children. They scream his name.)",
          "options": [
            {
              "text": "\"Carry me go Lagos with you, Ike.\"",
              "effects": {
                "remember": {
                  "ikeAsk": "begged"
                },
                "changeStat": {
                  "ikeTrust": 3
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "\"How did you make this money, Ike? Tell me true.\"",
              "effects": {
                "remember": {
                  "ikeAsk": "how"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "\"Na yahoo you dey do, abi?\"",
              "effects": {
                "remember": {
                  "ikeAsk": "accused"
                },
                "changeStat": {
                  "ikeTrust": -6
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "ike",
          "text": "Lagos is for people with liver, Emeka. And money. To enter my business, you pay connection fee. ₦150,000. Nkwọ day, the 9 p.m. bus. If you're not there, I don't know you.",
          "variants": [
            {
              "if": {
                "memory": {
                  "ikeAsk": "accused"
                }
              },
              "text": "Yahoo? (He laughs, but not with his eyes.) Lagos is for people with liver. Connection fee: ₦150,000. Nkwọ day, 9 p.m. bus. Come with the money and keep your mouth for eating."
            },
            {
              "if": {
                "memory": {
                  "ikeAsk": "how"
                }
              },
              "text": "How? Hard work. And... connections. (He looks away.) You want in? Connection fee, ₦150,000. Nkwọ day, 9 p.m. bus."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "goto",
          "scene": "plan"
        }
      ],
      "location": "ikeHouse",
      "time": "day",
      "positions": {
        "ike": [
          28,
          -22,
          0
        ]
      }
    },
    "plan": {
      "beats": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "papaNgwo",
          "text": "You get that face. The face of a man about to do something stupid. Drink. Stupidity is better planned with palm wine."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "₦150,000. You have ₦1,200 and a graduate certificate with a coffee stain on it."
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "(Where will the money come from?)",
          "options": [
            {
              "text": "The harvest money. The council keeps it in a box under the big tree.",
              "effects": {
                "setFlag": "harvestTried",
                "goto": "harvest"
              },
              "requires": {
                "notFlags": [
                  "harvestTried"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "Papa's land. Uncle Dozie says he knows a buyer.",
              "effects": {
                "setFlag": "landTried",
                "goto": "land"
              },
              "requires": {
                "notFlags": [
                  "landTried"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "Chinwe's shop savings. She trusts you.",
              "effects": {
                "setFlag": "chinweTried",
                "goto": "chinweSavings"
              },
              "requires": {
                "notFlags": [
                  "chinweTried"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "Work at the quarry. Honest money, slow money.",
              "effects": {
                "setFlag": "quarryTried",
                "goto": "quarry"
              },
              "requires": {
                "notFlags": [
                  "quarryTried"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "location": "palmwine",
      "time": "day"
    },
